   "label": "Off-host copies",
   "description": "Every nightly backup set is also copied to the NAS share named in the server's settings file (OFFSITE_DIR), into a folder for this site, and checked against its checksums there. The share must carry the marker file .cw-offsite-target (RUNBOOK §10.5), so a NAS that is not mounted is never mistaken for it."
